st</p><p style="color:#1e293b;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0">Ada Lovelace</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;margin:0 0 24px"/><div style="background-color:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:16px"><p style="color:#0369a1;font-size:11px;margin:0 0 4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Parking Location</p><p style="color:#1e293b;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 4px">ResLab Lot</p><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 8px">99 ResLab Avenue</p><p style="margin:0"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=99%20ResLab%20Avenue" style="color:#0369a1;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">Get Directions →</a></p></div><div style="border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:16px"><table style="width:100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top"><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:11px;margin:0 0 4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Check-in</p><p style="color:#1e293b;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 2px">Tue, Oct 20, 2026</p><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;margin:0">10:00 AM</p></td><td style="width:50%;vertical-align:top"><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:11px;margin:0 0 4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px">Check-out</p><p style="color:#1e293b;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 2px">Sun, Oct 25, 2026</p><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;margin:0">2:00 PM</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="background-color:#fef7f5;border:1px solid #fed7ca;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:24px"><p style="color:#c2410c;font-size:11px;margin:0 0 4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:10px">Payment Summary</p><table style="width:100%"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:3px 0;color:#1e293b;font-size:14px">Parking — 3 days</td><td style="padding:3px 0;color:#1e293b;font-size:14px;text-align:right">$120.00</td