p style="color:#64748b;font-size:12px;margin:0;line-height:1.5"><strong style="color:#1e293b">Need help?</strong> <a href="https://www.triplypro.com/help" style="color:#f87356;text-decoration:none">Help Center</a> | <a href="https://www.triplypro.com/contact" style="color:#f87356;text-decoration:none">Contact Us</a></p></div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;margin:0 30px"/><table style="width:100%;padding:16px 30px"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:center"><p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;margin:0;line-height:1.6">© 2026 Triply · Your Trip Simplified<br/>You received this email because you booked on triplypro.com</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"`;

