;text-align:right;font-weight:700;border-top:1px solid #fed7ca">$199.60</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px"><a href="https://www.triplypro.com/confirmation/RTL-TEST" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#f87356;color:#ffffff;padding:12px 32px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px">View Booking Details</a></div><div style="background-color:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:24px"><p style="color:#1e293b;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 10px">What to Expect</p><ol style="color:#475569;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;padding-left:18px;margin:0"><li>Drive to the parking facility on your check-in date</li><li>Scan your QR code at the entrance gate</li><li>Park and take the shuttle to the terminal</li><li>On return, call for shuttle pickup and retrieve your vehicle</li></ol></div><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:12px;margin:0 0 4px;line-height:1.5"><strong style="color:#1e293b">Cancellation:</strong> Free up to 24 hours before check-in. Late cancellations may incur fees.</p><p style="color:#64748b;font-size:12px;margin:0;line-height:1.5"><strong style="color:#1e293b">Need help?</strong> <a href="https://www.triplypro.com/help" style="color:#f87356;text-decoration:none">Help Center</a> | <a href="https://www.triplypro.com/contact" style="color:#f87356;text-decoration:none">Contact Us</a></p></div><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;margin:0 30px"/><table style="width:100%;padding:16px 30px"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:center"><p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:11px;margin:0;line-height:1.6">© 2026 Triply · Your Trip Simplified<br/>You received this email because you booked on triplypro.com</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"`;

